            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yakoba ati: “Imwe abantu b'omu Buyudaaya, ebibi byaimwe tibibavaaku naire. Biri ng'oti byaghandiikibwa ku myoyo gyaimwe ni ku bintu ebiri ng'oti mayiga ga nsolo ebiri ku nsonda eina edh'alutaari dhaimwe. Ebibi byaimwe biri ng'omuntu bweyandibighandiise ku bipande n'ekalaamu ey'ekyuma ekigumu einho eri n'omunwa ogw'eibaale ery'omughendo eryetebwa diamondi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baimwe tibeerabiranga kusinziza Ashera omusambwa omukazi, ku alutaari dhaibwe, ni buli ghansi mu kinsense eky'omuti omuzibirivu, ni ku buli kasozi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni ku buli lusozi olugulumivu oluli mu irungu. Eby'obukombe byaimwe n'ebintu byaimwe eby'omughendo, nja kubighaayo abazigu babinhage olw'okusasulamu ebibi ebingi bye mukoze mu nsi eno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulirekula ensi ye nabagha ng'omugabo ogwaimwe, abazigu baagitwala. Nja kubafuula bagheereza ba bazigu baimwe eyo mu nsi ye mutaidhi naire, kuba obusungu bwange butumbwike ng'oti muliro era tiguja kuzikira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
